{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"75fff42fdb61e847adeeef4024929ca4643cb4590e595727c4f0bcf9f92f8ce0","ja":"まったく、茜ちゃん使いが荒いよー！\n事務所の備品が足りないからって！","zh":"真是的，太会使唤小茜了啦——！\n就因为事务所的用品不够了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6a0c4b101ef9f5baa3ce3efa09ecac46d1396544be381101fbceffa174543531","ja":"いいじゃないですか～、こうして一緒に\n買い物に来られたんですから♪","zh":"有什么关系嘛～，毕竟能像这样一起\n来买东西了呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"19547fd9ed6d734b31a84a5fa68d627a8b30bacd1e7068f89bec83f00baad7ff","ja":"それにしても人が多いですね～。\nはぐれないように手を繋いで行きましょうか？","zh":"话说回来，人真多呢～\n为了不走散，要牵着手走吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8b706cac04cb94ebe67c78dbd2a7cc480da5349149826beebb04bd97a7dd9093","ja":"ええっ！？　茜ちゃんはいいけど……\n朋花ちゃんからそんなこと言うなんて珍しいね？","zh":"诶！？　小茜倒是无所谓啦……\n朋花居然会主动提这种事，真少见呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d3dcd7e77f82d3309efcf9340b82d04bac18df90c4c11d1670aba94a4d6c4e21","ja":"ふふっ、迷子になったら困りますから～。\n絶対に離さないでくださいね、茜さん？","zh":"呵呵，要是走丢了可就伤脑筋了～。\n绝对不要松开哦，茜？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"35102fec76e48c2d4ea29eb480bfa92e3ca3bd29b49ca610b78379e85e3779a6","ja":"（大人っぽい朋花ちゃんでも、やっぱり茜ちゃんには\n甘えたくなっちゃうんだね！　うんうん♪）","zh":"（就算是成熟的朋花，果然还是想对小茜\n撒娇呢！嗯嗯♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d4fc36bdd29cf48154de618541a962c0bb8a0130725701d3e32971a171b57073","ja":"えっ、今から私と自主レッスンしたいの？","zh":"诶，现在想和我一起自主练习吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"308795d4f65dc75632ab4301c9a482bdc5a154f302a9363efe4daf7ba289be94","ja":"はい～。ぜひこのみさんに\nアドバイスをもらえたらと思いまして～。","zh":"好的～。要是能得到木实姐的\n建议就好了～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f4e11860ef8541c78720756be26d792ad4b399161b2e9f66a50df1191b914523","ja":"なるほど、そういうことならお姉さんに任せなさい！\nいくらでも付き合ってあげるわ♪","zh":"原来如此，既然是这样就包在大姐姐身上吧！\n要陪你多久都行哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1419.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"da2969ddb3ce588b9cc8d185de96e09d2ca7c7c2dbe4489e312e84a030af2556","ja":"（朋花ちゃんがこんなに頼りにしてくれるなんて……\nしっかり期待に応えなきゃ♪）","zh":"（朋花这么依赖我……\n可得好好回应她的期待才行♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
